AnalyticsOverview.description:
The traffic analytics of a range, for all hosts or one: visitors and content, and clients and bots (docs/design/observability.md "Traffic analytics"). Computed from the
access-log drain, so a host with its access log off is absent. Visitors, the top tables and the per-path figures are approximate by design;
each table row carries its own bound.

html.description:
ErrorPageMode.Html only: a complete document, up to 64 KiB of UTF-8. It is served with
        `Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; font-src data:; base-uri 'none';
        form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'`, so inline style and `data:` images work and nothing runs or loads from elsewhere.
